        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": "፴፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፴፯ ፤ ወይቤሎሙ ፡ ሑሩ ፡ በሰላም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሁንም ፡ ሂዱ ፡ በደህና ፡ አላቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤልዎ ፡ ቀሠፉነ ፡ ገሃደ ፡ ዘአልብነ ፡ አበሳ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዘ ፡ ሰብአ ፡ ሮሜ ፡ ንሕነ ፡ ወሞቅሑነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሮም ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ስንሆን ፡ በደል ፡ ሳይኖ",
