          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፲፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በት ፡ ምኵራብ ፡ ገብቶ ፡ ከመጻሕፍት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እየጠቀሰ ፡ ሦስት ፡ ሱባኤ ፡ ሲከራከራ",
